  <ym-title|Conservation-to-cone supplier \V draft, independent review
  pending><label|conservation-to-cone-supplier--draft-independent-review-pending>

  Pin3456e5e75cf8d4cd558955a5c7638fba2d68f464; parent author
  hairer-codex-existence-20261111. Output physical-ward-stress-cone.tex. Uses
  the separate positive-packet candidate for moments, even subtraction, axis
  walk, genuine gap, dyadic kernel and finite algebra. No global rotation or
  distributional collision value assumed.

  <section|Result and retained upstream inputs><label|result-and-retained-upstream-inputs>

  Proves actual positive cone exponent delta+4a for the diagonal-stress
  measure, including the needed a=-99,delta=1 value -395, from the same
  smooth hierarchy, polynomial separated derivatives, actual
  derivative/orientation identities, real symmetric conserved
  signed-coordinate stress, and OS chambers. These are substantive upstream
  inputs from stress production, not merely a formal record with the desired
  estimate. Positive packet draft must pass separately.

  <section|Source map, all under Lean/YM/Next/ROTATIONS><label|source-map-all-under-leanymnextrotations>

  <\itemize-minus>
    <item>Collision article/battle/projections/radical/integrate_both; Fold
    collect/gen definitions through their consumers; Pairs
    pair_bound/pair_dif/pair_dif_neg: finite product-Taylor extension,
    polynomial bound, actual off-collision IBP.

    <item>Journal portrays/Portrait, writer_move/writer_off/symmetric_writer,
    joint/joined/joint_home/inversion_nil/joint_null. Tensor parity and pair
    symmetries preserved by subtracting the actual linear divergence
    coefficient times evaluation at0. Not arbitrary rotational invariant
    renormalization.

    <item>Symbol Strong/stronger, closed_shell/pupils,
    lifted_cost/source_cost: divergence finite in separate jets, no terms of
    total order\<less\>3 after correction, exponent3a; source moment/flat
    conventions explicit.

    <item>Odd OddB/Tail.correct/odd_rep/parcel/versus; Mode white/one_mode:
    actual odd parity residual, derivative-Lipschitz bound and support split
    E\<less\>=w/E\<gtr\>=w; common positive kernel majorant. No 'even only'
    shortcut.

    <item>Cross cross_le: same undamped PVM, positive 2x2 density and
    elementary CS; polarization fits/integrability retained; energy0
    included.

    <item>Nodal baked_budget/fix_cost: finite induction over shrinking
    coordinate set, residual handled by one_mode, coefficients bounded for
    w\<less\>=0; every fixed annular correction handed to smaller induction,
    no infinite profile uniformity.

    <item>Sources enters_weights/equalRead; Pier
    dig/signsD/signD_both/signD_real, first_lift/second_lift/expenses/fixed:
    diagonal stress raised in fixed-band axis, division of away-zero
    frequency profile, factors -I and +I, honest signed representative
    cluster atorigin via finite reflection projection.

    <item>Constraints SelfB/BL/CL, DB/DC, BL_law/CL_law, accounts_cost,
    accounts_sink/accounts_fixed: exact two contact identities; budgets4a/6a,
    fixed-band delta,delta+2a,delta+4a, contact vanishing moment thresholds.

    <item>Pivot valued/heights/debris_cost/rift/budget_lock: width-normalized
    responses at p=1,2 and k=0,1,2, contact differences exponent2a, constant
    correction coefficients cancel, remaining differences exponent2a.

    <item>Mass concentrated/intersects/mass: choose one m after finite source
    order, actual diagonal cluster, three signs via (-E\<twosuperior\>)^k,
    same tau\<gtr\>0 Fourier normalization, kernel lower bound converts
    delta+2a into delta+4a.
  </itemize-minus>

  Commands actually run: scoped rg declaration searches and sed reads of
  these files; creation of LaTeX/evidence; no Lean edits, build or axiom
  replay. Shared literature notes searched in parent packet task; canonical
  SNAG and heat proof reused. No optional large literature search.
  Build/render/checks pending.

